### marko@korhonen.cc ###
# IMAP
IMAPAccount marko
Host imap.migadu.com
Port 993
User marko@korhonen.cc
PassCmd "head -1 ~/.mail_cred/marko"
TLSType IMAPS

# Remote
IMAPStore marko-remote
Account marko

# Local
MaildirStore marko-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.local/share/mail/marko/
Inbox ~/.local/share/mail/marko/Inbox

# Channel
Channel marko
Far :marko-remote:
Near :marko-local:
Patterns *
SyncState *
Create Both
Expunge Both


